@startuml fr01-courses-topics-deadlines
' Origin: drafted with AI assistance (Claude Code) from FR-01 in docs/02-requirements.md; reviewed by the author.
title FR-01 Manage courses, topics and deadlines
|Student|
start
:POST /courses {code, name};
|Planner|
if (code/name valid and code not used by this student?) then (yes)
  :Create Course (code upper-cased);
else (no)
  :400 invalid / 409 duplicate code;
  stop
endif
|Student|
:POST /courses/{id}/topics {name};
|Planner|
if (course is the student's?) then (no)
  :404;
  stop
endif
if (topic name unique in course (ignoring case)?) then (yes)
  :Add Topic to Course;
  :Save, publish **TopicCreated** → planner.topics;
else (no)
  :409;
  stop
endif
|Tutor|
:Consume TopicCreated;
:Save TopicReference (read model);
|Student|
:POST /courses/{id}/deadlines\n{title, dueAt (Sydney), weight, topicIds};
|Planner|
if (dueAt in the future, weight 1–100,\n≥ 1 topic of this course?) then (no)
  :400;
  stop
elseif (total weight of course ≤ 100 %?) then (no)
  :409;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Add Deadline (dueAt stored as UTC);
  :201 Created;
endif
stop
@enduml
